  '["Public Infrastructure Identifier, for public cloud resources.","Personally Identifiable Information, data that can identify an individual.","Private Instance Information, related to private network configurations.","Programmatic Interface Identifier, for API endpoint definitions."]'::json,
  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) defines PII as Personally Identifiable Information. This refers to any data that can be used to identify a specific individual, such as name, address, email, or social security number. Protecting PII is a critical aspect of sensitive data management and compliance. Options A, C, and D are not standard definitions for PII.',
