  '["Use AWS SAM CLI for local testing with DynamoDB Local","Implement blue/green deployments for Lambda functions","Create a separate AWS account for each developer","Increase the provisioned concurrency for Lambda functions"]'::json,
  '{0}',
  'Option A (Use AWS SAM CLI for local testing with DynamoDB Local) allows developers to validate their code without affecting production resources or incurring costs, directly addressing the anti-pattern of testing against production resources. Option B (Implement blue/green deployments for Lambda functions) is a deployment strategy for production, not a local testing solution. Option C (Create a separate AWS account for each developer) is an overkill and still involves cloud costs for testing. Option D (Increase the provisioned concurrency for Lambda functions) relates to performance, not preventing data corruption during development testing.',
  NOW(),
