  'Option B (To group related actions that perform a specific part of the release process) is the correct purpose of a stage in AWS CodePipeline. Stages organize actions like Source, Build, Test, and Deploy. Option A describes an ''action'' within a stage. Option C is handled by the Source stage''s action. Option D is related to environment variable management, which can be done at various levels but is not the primary purpose of a stage.',
