  'Which AWS service is a fully managed source control service that hosts secure Git-based repositories?',
  'mcq',
  '["AWS CodeBuild","AWS CodeDeploy","AWS CodePipeline","AWS CodeCommit"]'::json,
  '{3}',
  'Option D (AWS CodeCommit) is the correct service. AWS CodeCommit is a fully managed source control service that makes it easy for companies to host secure and highly scalable Git repositories. Option A (AWS CodeBuild) is for building and testing code. Option B (AWS CodeDeploy) is for deploying code. Option C (AWS CodePipeline) orchestrates the CI/CD workflow.',
