  '{0}',
  'Option A (`buildspec.yml`) is a collection of build commands and related settings that AWS CodeBuild uses to run a build. Option B (`appspec.yml`) is used by AWS CodeDeploy to manage deployments. Option C (`template.yaml`) is used by AWS SAM for defining serverless applications. Option D (`Dockerfile`) is used for defining Docker container images.',
