  'Which AWS service is primarily used by AWS CodePipeline to store build artifacts between stages, such as compiled code or deployment packages?',
  'mcq',
  '["AWS CodeArtifact","Amazon ECR","Amazon S3","AWS CodeCommit"]'::json,
  '{2}',
  'Option C (Amazon S3) is commonly used by AWS CodePipeline as the default artifact store to securely store and pass artifacts (like source code, build output, or deployment packages) between different stages of a pipeline. Option A (AWS CodeArtifact) is a managed artifact repository service for software packages like npm or Maven, not general build artifacts for CodePipeline. Option B (Amazon ECR) is a Docker container registry. Option D (AWS CodeCommit) is a source control service.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain30_6',
