  '["Create an AWS Lambda function","Configure Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) settings","Enable the Function URL feature for the Lambda function","Choose the authentication type (e.g., AWS_IAM or NONE)"]'::json,
  '{0,2,3,1}',
  'To enable and configure a Lambda Function URL, you first need to have an existing AWS Lambda function (Option A). Then, you enable the Function URL feature directly on that Lambda function (Option C). After enabling, you choose the desired authentication type, such as AWS_IAM or NONE (Option D). Finally, if needed for browser-based access, you configure the Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) settings (Option B).',
