  '{0,1,2}',
  'Option A (Source) is where CodePipeline retrieves the source code. Option B (Build) is where CodePipeline compiles the code and runs tests, typically using AWS CodeBuild. Option C (Deploy) is where CodePipeline deploys the application, often using AWS CodeDeploy. Option D (Monitor) and Option E (Scale) are operational aspects, not standard stages within a CodePipeline definition itself, although monitoring and scaling are critical post-deployment activities.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain30_6',
