  '["AWS Secrets Manager","AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store","Amazon S3","AWS CodeCommit","AWS CloudFormation"]'::json,
  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS Secrets Manager) is a service that helps you protect access to your applications, services, and IT resources by rotating, managing, and retrieving database credentials, API keys, and other secrets throughout their lifecycle. Option B (AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store) provides secure, hierarchical storage for configuration data management and secrets management. Both are suitable for managing environment variables and sensitive data in CI/CD. Option C (Amazon S3) is for object storage. Option D (AWS CodeCommit) is for source code. Option E (AWS CloudFormation) is for infrastructure as code.',
