  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS CodeArtifact) is a fully managed artifact repository service that allows you to store, publish, and share software packages. Option B (Amazon S3) is widely used for storing build artifacts, deployment packages, and other static assets generated during a CI/CD pipeline. Option C (AWS CodeCommit) is for source code version control. Option D (AWS CodePipeline) orchestrates the CI/CD workflow. Option E (AWS Lambda) is a serverless compute service.',
