  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (Lambda Layers) allow you to package libraries, a custom runtime, or other dependencies that your Lambda functions can use. Option B (Custom Runtimes) enable you to use a programming language not supported by default by Lambda. Option C (Amazon S3 buckets) are used to store the deployment package itself, not included in the package. Option D (AWS CodeCommit repositories) store source code. Option E (Amazon ECR images) can be used as a deployment package type for Lambda, but are not ''components included'' in the same way layers or runtimes are for a standard .zip package.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain30_6',
  NOW(),
