  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS Secrets Manager) is a service that helps you protect access to your applications, services, and IT resources by rotating, managing, and retrieving database credentials, API keys, and other secrets. Option B (AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store) provides secure, hierarchical storage for configuration data management and secrets management. Option C (Amazon S3) is for object storage. Option D (AWS CodeBuild) is a build service. Option E (AWS CloudFormation) is for infrastructure as code.',
