  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS CloudFormation) allows you to define and provision entire environments (stacks) as code, making it easy to create identical dev/test environments. Option B (AWS SAM) extends CloudFormation for serverless applications, enabling the creation of dedicated serverless dev/test environments. Option C (Amazon EC2) provides compute capacity but doesn''t define the environment itself. Option D (AWS CodeCommit) is for source control. Option E (AWS CodeBuild) is a build service.',
