  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS SAM templates) are used to define serverless applications and their resources, which can then be deployed to staging environments. Option B (AWS CloudFormation templates) are used to define and provision AWS infrastructure, including entire application stacks, making them suitable for deploying to staging environments. Option C (Amazon SQS) is a message queuing service. Option D (AWS CodeCommit) is for source code version control. Option E (Amazon ECR) is a container registry.',
