  '{0,1}',
  'Option A (AWS SAM CLI) provides a local environment to test Lambda functions and API Gateway locally. Option B (DynamoDB Local) allows developers to run a local version of DynamoDB on their machines for local development and testing. Option C (AWS CodeBuild) is a cloud-based build service. Option D (AWS CodeDeploy) is for deploying applications. Option E (Amazon S3) is for object storage.',
