  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'To import external key material into KMS, first, create a Customer Managed Key (CMK) in KMS (Option B) and specify its key material origin as ''External''. Next, download the wrapping key and import token (Option A) that KMS provides for this CMK. Then, encrypt your actual key material (Option C) using the downloaded wrapping key outside of AWS. Finally, upload the encrypted key material along with the import token (Option D) back to KMS to complete the CMK creation with your external key material.',
