  '{0,1,3,2}',
  'First, an Amazon S3 bucket must exist (Option A). Then, a bucket policy is attached to this S3 bucket (Option B). Within this policy, a Deny statement is added (Option D) to block requests. This Deny statement includes a condition that checks if ''aws:SecureTransport'' is false (Option C), effectively denying any non-HTTPS requests.',
