  '{3,0,1,2}',
  'Automatic key rotation can only be enabled for customer managed keys, so the first step is to create a new AWS KMS customer managed key (Option D). Once created, you select that specific CMK (Option A). From the CMK''s details page, you navigate to the ''Key rotation'' settings (Option B). Finally, you enable the ''Automatic key rotation'' option (Option C) to have AWS KMS automatically rotate the key material annually.',
