  '["Navigate to the bucket''s ''Properties'' tab","Enable ''Default encryption'' for the bucket","Select ''Amazon S3 key (SSE-S3)'' as the encryption type","Create an Amazon S3 bucket"]'::json,
  '{3,0,1,2}',
  'To configure default encryption, you must first create an Amazon S3 bucket (Option D). Once the bucket is created, navigate to its ''Properties'' tab (Option A). Within the properties, locate and enable the ''Default encryption'' setting (Option B). Finally, choose ''Amazon S3 key (SSE-S3)'' (Option C) as the desired encryption type, which uses AWS-managed keys for server-side encryption.',
