VALUES (
  'q_29_m_29_3_96',
  'Order the steps to apply an IAM policy condition to restrict access to an Amazon S3 bucket based on the source IP address.',
  'ordering',
  '["Attach the IAM policy to the relevant IAM user or role","Create an IAM policy with `s3:GetObject` action for the S3 bucket","Add a `Condition` block to the policy statement, specifying `aws:SourceIp`","Define the allowed IP address range in the `aws:SourceIp` condition"]'::json,
