  '{2,1,0,3}',
  'The first critical step is to identify all sensitive data that might be present in application outputs (Option C). Once identified, the application code must be modified to redact or mask these sensitive fields before they are ever sent to CloudWatch Logs (Option B). Implementing structured logging (Option A) further helps in controlling and filtering log content. Finally, configuring appropriate log retention policies (Option D) ensures that logs, even if sanitized, are not stored indefinitely.',
