  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'Before a Lambda function can retrieve a secret, its execution role must be granted IAM permissions to access that specific secret in AWS Secrets Manager (Option A). At runtime, the AWS Lambda function code then calls the AWS Secrets Manager GetSecretValue API (Option B). AWS Secrets Manager validates the request and returns the secret value (Option C). Finally, the AWS Lambda function processes and uses the retrieved secret (Option D) as needed.',
