  '{2,1,3,0}',
  'The initial step for safe logging is to identify all sensitive data fields within the request payloads (Option C) that should not be logged. Next, implement a logging library or custom logic within the Lambda function to redact or mask these identified sensitive fields before logging (Option B). After implementation, it''s crucial to test the logging with sample sensitive data to verify that redaction is working correctly (Option D). Finally, configure appropriate log retention policies in Amazon CloudWatch Logs (Option A) to manage the lifecycle of the logs.',
