  '["Shift production traffic from the original (blue) environment to the new (green) environment","Deploy the new application version to the newly provisioned green environment","Provision a new, identical environment (green) alongside the existing (blue) environment","Terminate the original (blue) environment after successful traffic shift"]'::json,
  '{2,1,0,3}',
  'A blue/green deployment strategy starts by setting up the new environment. Option C is to provision a new, identical ''green'' environment. Next, Option B is to deploy the new application version to this green environment. Once the new version is validated, Option A involves shifting production traffic from the old ''blue'' environment to the new ''green'' environment. Finally, Option D is to terminate the old ''blue'' environment, completing the update with minimal downtime.',
