  '["AfterInstall, for post-installation tasks","ApplicationStart, to start the application","ApplicationStop, to stop the application before updates","BeforeInstall, for pre-installation tasks"]'::json,
  '{2,3,0,1}',
  'The `AppSpec` file defines a sequence of lifecycle events for CodeDeploy. Option C, `ApplicationStop`, is typically the first event, stopping the application before any updates are applied. Next, Option D, `BeforeInstall`, runs any scripts or tasks before the new application revision is installed. Following this, Option A, `AfterInstall`, executes tasks after the new application files have been placed. Finally, Option B, `ApplicationStart`, starts the application with the new revision.',
