  'A development team wants to use API Gateway stages to manage different deployment environments (dev, test, prod). Order the steps to configure API Gateway stages.',
  'ordering',
  '["Deploy the API to a new stage (e.g., ''dev'', ''test'', ''prod'').","Create an API Gateway REST API or HTTP API.","Configure stage variables for environment-specific settings.","Test the API endpoints in the newly created stage."]'::json,
  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'To manage API Gateway stages, first create an API Gateway REST API or HTTP API (Option B) with your defined resources and methods. Then, deploy the API to a new stage (Option A), giving it a name like ''dev'', ''test'', or ''prod''. Next, configure stage variables (Option C) for that stage to store environment-specific settings, such as backend endpoint URLs. Finally, test the API endpoints (Option D) in the newly created stage to ensure proper functionality.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain30_6',
  NOW(),
  78,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_30_2',
  'medium'
);

INSERT INTO public.question (id, text, type, options, correct_answer, explanation, created_at, quiz_id, modified_at, index, pairs, matches, module_id, difficulty)
VALUES (
